heb>לִסְבֹּל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וַיֵּט שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,15)\">Gen 49:15</ref> (poem in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; Issachar under figure of ass), compare <ref ref=\"Gen 21:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,14)\">Gen 21:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 24:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,15)\">Gen 24:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 24:45\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,45)\">Gen 24:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 12:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,34)\">Exod 12:34</ref>, also <ref ref=\"Gen 9:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,23)\">Gen 9:23</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 4:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,4,5)\">Josh 4:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 9:48\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,48)\">Judg 9:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 10:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,27)\">Isa 10:27</ref> (|| <bdbheb>צַוָּאר</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Isa 14:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,25)\">Isa 14:25</ref> (both figurative), <ref ref=\"Ps 81:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"81\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"81\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,81,7)\">Ps 81:7</ref>, so, metaphorical, of responsibility of rule <ref ref=\"Isa 9:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,5)\">Isa 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 22:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,22)\">Isa 22:22</ref>= (symbolized by key), of accusation as (easy) burden <ref ref=\"Job 31:36\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,36)\">Job 31:36</ref> figurative also <bdbheb>אֶחָד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְעָבְדוֺ שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:9\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,9)\">Zeph 3:9</ref> <highlight>to serve him</highlight> (with) <highlight>one shoulder</highlight> (as one man), of. Syriac <placeholder5534/>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> in statement of Saul's height, <bdbheb>מִשִּׁכְמוֺ וָמַ֫עְלָה גָּכֹהַּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מִכָּלהָֿעָם</bdbheb><ref ref=\"1Sam 9:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,2)\">1Sam 9:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:23\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,23)\">1Sam 10:23</ref> and (with play on proper name, of a location <bdbheb>שְׁכֶם</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>אַהַד עַלאַֿחֶיךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נָתַתִּי לְךָ שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 48:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,48,22)\">Gen 48:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in general <highlight>back:</highlight> <bdbheb>כְּהַפְנֹתוֺ שִׁכְמוֺ לָלֶכֶת מֵעִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,9)\">1Sam 10:9</ref> so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תְּשִׁיתֵמוֺ שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 21:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,21,13)\">Ps 21:13</ref>, i.e. make them turn (in flight; compare <bdbheb>וְאוֺיְבַי נָתַתָּה לִי עֹרֶף</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 18:41\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,41)\">Ps 18:41</ref>); as beaten <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַטֵּה שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 9:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,3)\">Isa 9:3</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שֵׁבֶט הַנֹּנֵשׂ בּוֺ</bdbheb>); more anatomical <bdbheb>תִפּוֺל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּתֵפִי מִשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 31:22\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,22)\">Job 31:22</ref> <highlight>let my shoulder blade fall from its back</highlight>. — <ref ref=\"Hos 6:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,6,9)\">Hos 6:9</ref> see II.  <bdbheb><reflink>שְׁכֶם</reflink></bdbheb> below </p></div><hr><p><bdbheb>שִׁכְמָה</bdbheb> see foregoing.</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Zeph 3:9", "book": "ZEP", "chapter": 3, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Gen 48:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 48, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Gen 33:19", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 33, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ps 21:13", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Gen 9:23", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 9, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Gen 49:15", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Job 31:22", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 31, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Gen 21:14", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 21, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 24:15", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 24, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Gen 24:45", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 24, "verse": 45}, {"raw": "Exod 12:34", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Josh 4:5", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 4, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Judg 9:48", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 48}, {"raw": "Isa 10:27", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Isa 14:25", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Ps 81:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 81, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Isa 9:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 9, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Isa 22:22", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Job 31:36", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 31, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "1S